# Nothing here is secret, but these have no business in a repository.

# Facilitator home addresses. Held only in the build folder, never shipped,
# never committed. If this file ever appears here, something has gone wrong.
**/group_addresses.private.json

# Contracts and invoices live in the working folder, not in the repo.
01_contract/
02_invoices/

# Python and editor noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.venv/

# Open Sans IS committed, deliberately. 282 KB across nine woff2 files.
#
# This used to exclude them, on the reasoning that binaries make a history
# heavy and the fetch script is right there. Both true, and both beside the
# point: with the fonts excluded, everyone who received this repository got a
# map in the wrong typeface. The Pages preview Kosha reviews, and the folder
# Noah uploads, would both have silently fallen back to the system sans while
# the brand guidelines ask for Open Sans.
#
# A font the deliverable cannot be delivered without is not a build artifact.
# 282 KB once, against a step every recipient has to know to run and would not.
#
# The licence is satisfied either way: OFL permits redistribution, and OFL.txt
# sits beside the files.
